Self-replicating spacecraft (Von Neumann)
Dyson sphere: capture star energy output
Space elevator: cable from surface to space with crawler moving along
Faster-than-light (FTL): 
- Alcubierre drive: faster-than-light travel by space contraction
- Wormhole: connection between points in spacetime

Oblique wing: aircraft with single wing rotating in center, to reduce drag at high speeds
Tokamak: controlled nuclear fusion, strong magnetic field around plasma

Kardashev scale: civilization technological level based on energy use
- Type I: planetary
- Type II: stellar
- Type III: galactic
